# Large desktop/mobile build artifacts. Nothing in src/App.tsx links to
# /downloads/ anymore (all download buttons point at GitHub Releases — see
# the GH/GH1 constants), so this directory doesn't need to ship with the
# deployment at all. Left un-added to .gitignore/git rather than deleted —
# these are pre-existing local files, not something to clean up unasked.
public/downloads/
dist/downloads/
# Vercel builds remotely from source; the local build output (already
# git-ignored) has no reason to be part of the upload either — it pulled in
# the same public/downloads/ copy vite copies verbatim on build, which is
# what pushed the upload past the 100MB single-file limit in the first place.
dist/
